謝謝你把艾蜜莉介紹給我

360
00:21:27,510 --> 00:21:30,850
No problem. I'm so glad I could help,you know?
不客氣，我樂得幫忙 

361
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:32,710
I'm happy for you.
我很替你開心

362
00:21:32,990 --> 00:21:34,980
Happy for you.
我才替你開心

363
00:21:35,190 --> 00:21:37,160
Oh,no,happy for you.
不，我才替你開心

364
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,960
All right. Here's what we'll do.
好，接下來是這樣

365
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:46,430
You are going to take off my clothes.
你幫我脫衣服

366
00:21:46,930 --> 00:21:48,920
You two,go get the oils.
你們兩個去拿精油

367
00:21:49,140 --> 00:21:51,300
And you,just constantly scream...
你就一直興奮的叫 

368
00:21:51,540 --> 00:21:53,940
..."Chandler's the king! Chandler's the king!"
「吾王錢德萬歲！」

369
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:56,630
I want to be with her. I like her.
我想跟她在一起，我喜歡她

370
00:21:56,910 --> 00:21:59,880
That's fine. Go with your instincts!
沒問題，大家隨意

371
00:22:00,080 --> 00:22:01,450
What am I doing again?
我要做什麼？

372
00:22:01,650 --> 00:22:04,410
Pay attention. I could wake up at any moment.
專心一點，我隨時都會醒來

373
00:22:04,650 --> 00:22:07,090
I'm Joshua. I'm here to pick up Rachel.
我是約書亞，我來接瑞秋

374
00:22:07,390 --> 00:22:09,120
That's not Joshua.
他不是約書亞

375
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:12,920
What do you want from me? I never met the guy.
你想怎樣？我又沒見過他

376
00:22:13,430 --> 00:22:15,220
I'm sorry you can't stay.
可惜你要走了 

377
00:22:15,460 --> 00:22:18,760
The rest of us have a lot of work to do.
我們還有很多事要忙

378
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:23,960
What are you doing?
你幹什麼？

379
00:22:24,970 --> 00:22:27,100
All right,listen. I got to wake up.
好，我得醒過來

380
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


381
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
